      "notes": {
        "summary": "vfstool finds OpenMW's own configuration again, as the Rust program did.",
        "fixed": [
          "With neither `--config` nor OPENMW_CONFIG, vfstool reads the openmw.cfg in the folder OpenMW keeps its own in on this platform: Documents\\My Games\\OpenMW on Windows, wherever Documents was moved, Library/Preferences/openmw on macOS, and the XDG config folder elsewhere. Its `?userconfig?` and `?userdata?` are OpenMW's own folders. Needs jess 0.2.1 or later; the standalone downloads carry it."
        ]
      }
